name phfsvnwatermark
category Package
revision 41870
shortdesc Watermarks with version control information from SVN
relocated 1
longdesc This package allows you to add version control information as a
longdesc gray watermark on each page of your document. The SVN info is
longdesc read from keyword tags such as $Id$, $Date$, and $Author$ via
longdesc the svn or svn-multi packages.
runfiles size=2
